，扁平化几何插画，纯色块平涂，线条锐利清晰，带有复古印刷纸张肌理，色彩高饱和、对比强烈。\n\n画面构图与元素：\n\n- 整体竖版构图，边缘带浅米白复古海报边\n- 顶部区域：大字号红色粗体衬线字「INDONESIA」占据画面上方，下方配蓝色小字「The Vibrant July Edition」，文字下方带一条黄色装饰弧线\n- 背景区域：扁平化热带海滨日落场景，湖蓝色天空，橙黄色圆形落日，远处绿色低矮岛屿，蓝色海面带有落日反光；左右两侧分布深绿色椰子树，右侧有一座黑色剪影的巴厘岛传统凉亭，左下角有一座橙顶小屋\n- 前景主体：一卷从右下向左上展开的印尼巴迪克蜡染布，布面为蓝底白几何纹样，布边带有绿、红、黄多层色带；布料呈自然卷曲的波浪形态，带有体积感阴影；银色马头吊坠项链自然摆放在布面中央\n- 底部区域：深绿色块底色，正中央是白色复古衬线字体「OROLA」\n\n整体色彩：高饱和复古撞色，主色为正红、湖蓝、草绿、橙黄、米白、深绿；银饰保留真实金属磨砂质感，与扁平插画背景形成材质对比。", "empty", false, 1574141287, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"},